carnine-frontend: licences of the shipped software
==================================================

The CarNine user interface (opt/carnine/frontend/lib/libapp.so) is part of
CarNine, Copyright 2026 Carnine Project, licensed under GPL-3.0-only:
https://github.com/DerKleinePunk/carnine2/blob/main/LICENSE

The package holds, besides it:

  homescreen, libihs_shared.so    ivi-homescreen (Apache-2.0) and the
                                  submodules built into it, see
                                  ivi-homescreen-licenses.txt here
  libflutter_engine.so, icudtl.dat
                                  the Flutter engine with Skia, ICU, HarfBuzz
                                  and the rest of its third_party code
  libapp.so                       also the Dart packages it is built from
  libsqlite3.so                   SQLite, public domain
  libvideo_grabber_view.so        video_grabber (BSD-3-Clause, below)

The licences of the Flutter engine and of every Dart package are in
opt/carnine/frontend/data/flutter_assets/NOTICES.Z, gzip-compressed:

  zcat /opt/carnine/frontend/data/flutter_assets/NOTICES.Z | less

flutter_local_map (Dart package local_map) and video_grabber are our own
libraries under the BSD 3-Clause License:

